---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer FROM vector_search(qs, 'second', question) order by _score desc LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Projection: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question).id, vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question).answer                                                                                                                                           |
|               |   Sort: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question)._score DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=4                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |     TableScan: vector_search(qs, Utf8("second"), question) projection=[id, answer, _score]                                                                                                                                                               |
| physical_plan | ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@1 as answer]                                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |   SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@2 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=1000), expr=[_score@2 DESC NULLS LAST], preserve_partitioning=[false]                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |       ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@1 as answer, 1 - cosine_distance(CAST(query_vector() AS List(Field { data_type: Float32, nullable: true })), CAST(question_embedding@2 AS List(Field { data_type: Float32, nullable: true }))) as _score] |
|               |         SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |           BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                             |
|               |             DataSourceExec: partitions=1, partition_sizes=[2]                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
